flowchart TD
    File[Operation file or standard input] --> Launcher[run.py: optional launcher]
    Launcher --> Main[main.cpp: choose A or B]
    Main --> Runner[runner.cpp: validate and replay]
    Runner --> Factory[makeBackend: choose implementation]
    Factory --> LazyA[A + LAZY: segment tree]
    Factory --> StretchA[A + STRETCH: four-value tree]
    Factory --> LazyB[B + LAZY: block decomposition]
    LazyA --> API[RangeAnalytics common interface]
    StretchA --> API
    LazyB --> API
    Runner --> API
    API --> Output[Query results to standard output]
